# Internal source assets — keep these out of the public deploy
# api/ is the FastAPI backend (deployed on Render, not Vercel) — a repo-root
# "api" directory is Vercel's serverless-functions convention, so without this
# line Vercel tries to bundle the Python app as a function and fails on size.
api/
render.yaml
BIOFARM_BRAND_GUIDELINES/
**/*.docx
**/*.pdf
!habitat-hub/brochures/*.pdf
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/wetransfer_*/
**/*.DS_Store
.claude/
.vscode/
README.md
habitat-hub/Sleight Farm SRM 7.png
